==Historical==
In ''[[rsw:RuneScape|RuneScape 3]]'', Virtus robes were one of the rewards from Nex on her release in 2011. Compared to Old School RuneScape's version of the set, the original set had several differences:
* Having the robes equipped made all factions in the [[God Wars Dungeon]] unaggressive, rather than just Zarosian NPCs.
* The robes did not have a magic damage bonus, nor did it have a passive effect, and also required level 80 Hitpoints in addition to Magic and Defence.
* Robes lasted 15 hours in combat before needing to be repaired and each piece of the set boosted Hitpoints by a certain amount, equal to 40 Hitpoints:
