===Appearance===
The appearance of Virtus robes were altered as it, like [[Torva armour]], were believed to have clashed with the "simple and bold aesthetics" of Old School's art style. The level of detail of the original was designed for the larger world scale of ''RuneScape'', and thus was believed to have appeared "cluttered and out-of place".

However, models of the original appearance of the robes remain in the game's files:
<gallery heights="250" style="text-align:left">
File:Virtus robes equipped male original.png|The male model for the original Virtus robes.
File:Virtus robes equipped female original.png|The female model for the original Virtus robes.
</gallery>

===Additional set effect===
Virtus robes were also initially intended to have an additional effect that boosted the powers of [[Ancient Magicks]] when the full set was worn. This was scrapped during the second [[Unrestricted_world#DT2_Rewards_Beta|DT2 Rewards Beta]] as it was believed to be too powerful when used alongside the respective variants of the [[ancient sceptre]], which at the time of the first beta, increased the effects of their respective spell types by 35%.

